        {
          "q": "Is the solution compliant with the Belgian 2027 law?",
          "a": "Yes. Pointon meets all Belgian and CJEU legal requirements: objective recording, immutable audit trail, certified export."
        },
        {
          "q": "How is the data stored?",
          "a": "Data hosted in the EU (Vercel Postgres or self-hosted server). HTTPS encryption. GDPR compliant."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can I export the data?",
          "a": "Yes. CSV/PDF export digitally signed for legal inspection. Available on all plans."
        },
        {
          "q": "What is the setup time?",
          "a": "Setup in 5 minutes. Integration: 15 min. Immediate clock-in after account creation."
        },
        {
          "q": "Is there a trial period?",
          "a": "Unlimited Free plan with no commitment. Try for free, no card required."
        },
        {
          "q": "What happens if I clock in offline?",
          "a": "Your clock-in is saved locally and marked \"⏳ pending sync\". On reconnection, it automatically syncs to the server and becomes official. The presence board only counts synced clock-ins."
        }
      ]
    },
